(text "ACC sense: LOW = ignition ON; HIGH = OFF / USB-only. GPIO34 input, internal pulls OFF.\nR207 isolates the shared timer trigger from an MCU output-low fault.\nAssert MCU_HOLD_REQ early at boot; on ACC OFF close files, then release HOLD." (at 149.86 199.39 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))) (uuid "accede01-2026-4014-8000-000000000007"))

